---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="System Two"
  description="System Two is a venture development firm that builds and backs companies using hypothesis-led methodology, not idea-led theatre."
>
  <section class="section section--lg">
    <div class="container container--narrow">
      <h1>System Two</h1>
      <p class="lead">
        System Two is a venture development firm. We build and back companies
        across energy, healthcare, finance and technology — not by chasing ideas,
        but by rigorously defining and testing hypotheses.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <hr class="divider-accent" />

  <!-- Philosophy -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container container--narrow">
      <h2>How we work</h2>
      <p>
        Ideas are treated with suspicion. Hypotheses are treated seriously. We
        set up ventures, test assumptions, and live with the consequences. The
        result: doubled revenues year after year for over a decade.
      </p>
      <p>
        We operate as builders, not consultants. We've worked at board level with
        British Gas, Barclays, Experian, and GSK — always with skin in the game.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Framework overview -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container container--narrow">
      <h2>Because &gt; Someone &gt; Will</h2>
      <p>
        Every venture begins with a need-state hypothesis. We force ourselves to
        declare the behavioural driver (<strong>Because</strong>), identify a
        specific persona (<strong>Someone</strong>), and only then describe the
        solution (<strong>Will</strong>).
      </p>
      <p class="pull-quote mt-4">
        "The work of an entrepreneur is to define, refine, and prioritise
        hypotheses."
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Exits -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Track record</h2>
      <div class="grid grid--3 mt-3">
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Deep Green</h3>
          <p class="text-muted">Edge data centres &middot; Acquired by Octopus</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Elmo</h3>
          <p class="text-muted">EV subscription &middot; Acquired by BCA/Cinch</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Lifted</h3>
          <p class="text-muted">Senior care &middot; Acquired by British Gas</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Alligator Dental</h3>
          <p class="text-muted">Smart dental hardware &middot; GSK ecosystem</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Secret Source</h3>
          <p class="text-muted">Near-shore tech &middot; Acquired by ElevateUK</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Rinsing -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container container--narrow">
      <h2>Book a Rinsing workshop</h2>
      <p>
        Rinsing is our 4-6 week intensive process for breaking the ideas
        addiction. Exposure therapy for innovation. Teams dismantle ideas, define
        hypotheses, run experiments, and interpret data — weekly.
      </p>
      <a href="/contact" class="btn btn--primary mt-3">Get in touch</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .lead {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    color: var(--sys-color-on-surface-muted, #6b7280);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
</style>
